                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>30 feet. The escorite exudes an aura that reinforces the inevitability of nonexistence. Any creature that enters or begins their turn in the aura must attempt a @Check[will|dc:24] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 3} on a critical failure). On a successful save, a creature is temporarily immune to the escorite's aura for 24 hours.</p>"
                },
